# ---- Secrets ----
.env
*.local.md
.frontend-key.local

# ---- hermes-data/ is a live volume, not source ----
# Hermes writes dozens of directories into this path at runtime: SQLite
# databases (state.db, response_store.db, kanban.db), a ~4 MB models cache,
# session transcripts, sandboxes, lazy-installed packages — and several
# credential files (auth.json, mcp-tokens/, gateway.pid). Committing any of
# that would leak secrets and bloat the repo, so this is an allowlist: track
# only the things we author, ignore everything the agent generates.
#
# Note there are deliberately no memory files to track here, unlike mneme:
# user memory lives in MySQL under django_euf_admin, never on this volume.
#
# config.template.yaml is the source of truth. config.yaml is GENERATED from it
# by the adapter at startup, and the agent normalises that file in place — it is
# tracked anyway because the agent boots first (compose depends_on) and a
# missing one would let it create an unhardened default profile.
hermes-data/*
!hermes-data/.env.sample
!hermes-data/config.template.yaml
!hermes-data/config.yaml
!hermes-data/SOUL.md
!hermes-data/scripts/

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.python-version

# ---- Tests / tooling ----
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/

# ---- Editors / IDE ----
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp

# ---- Logs and OS cruft ----
*.log
logs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOTE: unlike farm_assistant_um, `tests/` and `scripts/` ARE tracked here.
# seed_profiles.sh is required to provision a pilot user at all, and the tests
# encode the two isolation guarantees (profile allowlist, derived memory scope)
# that make this service safe to point at real accounts. Both belong in the repo.

# ---- Local compose overrides (must not reach the deployed host) ----
docker-compose.override.yml

# ---- Markdown: only the two documents we author for people ----
# Everything else is either generated or an agent's working note: the container
# writes 261 skill READMEs into hermes-data/, dependency caches bring their own
# LICENSE.md, and *.local.md is already excluded above.
#
# NOTE the ordering: this sits AFTER the hermes-data allowlist, so SOUL.md has
# to be re-negated here — with .gitignore the LAST matching pattern wins.
*.md
!/README.md
!/hermes-data/SOUL.md
